.TH WAVE-UNLINK 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-unlink \- Remove the versionless shortcut. A later uninstall will not re-create it.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave unlink <package> | wave unlink \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the versionless shortcut. A later uninstall will not re-create
it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all, \-a
Apply to every installed package

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave unlink jq
wave unlink --all
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
